QuestGuidance.Register("es",113,{
[3585]="70065EAE\n1\tDeliver dwarf-beards to Cinaid at Gramsfoot\030Collect dwarf-beards ([según el diario]/7)\tCinaid directed you to collect dwarf-beards to use in creating a painful growth process for your sapling so that it will learn the scent of the dwarf and associate it with the pain of its adolescent growth.\n",
[3586]="70065EB3\n1\tSlaughter Leafcull bog-lurkers ([según el diario]/10)\tCinaid suggested you go to Hithlad and destroy creatures of nature there. Slaughter potential would-be allies to your sapling.\n2\tSpeak with Cinaid at Gramsfoot\tWith the lurkers defeated, you should return to Cinaid and tell them of your efforts.\n",
[3587]="70065EB2\n1\tMata a los Rascacuevas de Tumbahelada ([según el diario]/10)\tMake your way into the Isendeep Mine or Arador's End and decimate the cave-claws there.\n2\tSpeak with Cinaid at Gramsfoot\tNow that the cave-claws are defeated, return to Cinaid at Gramsfoot.\n",
[3588]="70065E9C\n1\tKill nerbyg near Tol Ascarnen ([según el diario]/10)\tMake your way to the waters surrounding Tol Ascarnen and kill the nerbyg present to ensure that their natural presence is diminished and cannot call to your sapling.\n2\tSpeak with Cinaid at Gramsfoot\tNow that the nerbyg he wanted dead are removed, return to Cinaid at Gramsfoot and inform them of the news.\n",
[3589]="70065EB0\n1\tCollect legs of Man ([según el diario]/7)\tCinaid asked you to collect legs of men to mash into the soil that feeds your sapling. Getting the taste for the blood of Men will defile the sapling.\n",
[3590]="70065EA9\n1\tSpeak with Gavran at Dâr-gazag\tMake your way to Dâr-gazag and speak with corruptor Gavran. Ask them about corrupting the sapling you discovered.\n2\tHabla con Cinaid\tReturn to Gramsfoot and find the Corruptor, Cinaid. They will tutor you in the best manner to despoil the sapling you found.\n",
[3591]="70065E9E\n1\tDeliver Elf-ears to Cinaid at Gramsfoot\030Collect Elf-ears ([según el diario]/7)\tCinaid directed you to slaughter Elves in the Ettenmoors and carve off their ears so that the strips can be added to the soil that feeds your sapling.\n",
[3592]="70066677\n1\tFind and slaughter free-folk ([según el diario]/15)\tCinaid wants you to make your way into the Ettenmoors and eliminate the Free Folk that wander there looking to assist the saplings. Slaughter them all!\n2\tHabla con Cinaid\tWith a good number of free-folk slain, you should return to Gramsfoot and inform Cinaid of your efforts.\n",
[3593]="70065EA1\n1\tCollect eagle feathers and deliver them to Cinaid at Gramsfoot ([según el diario]/7)\tHead to the east, in the shadow of the mountain that houses the Isendeep Mine, and hunt the eagles there for their feathers.\n",
[3594]="70065E9A\n1\tCollect hobbit-feet ([según el diario]/7)\tMake your way south to Hoarhallow and gather toes from the Little Folk there that you may feed the succulent flesh to your sapling.\n2\tDeliver the hobbit-feet to Cinaid at Gramsfoot\tDeliver the delectable feet to Cinaid at Gramsfoot.\n",
[3595]="7004041A\n1\tDefeat the captors of the Gondorian hostages\tCorsair captors can be found in a home in Lothgobel. You should defeat the Corsair captors in Lothgobel.\n2\tDefeat Corsair kidnappers (total: 8)\tCorsair captors can be found in a home in Lothgobel. You should defeat the Corsair captors in Lothgobel.\n3\tCompletado\tYou have defeated the Corsairs who kidnapped the townsfolk and held them captive in their home.\n",
[3596]="70040E0A\n1\tDefeat Corsairs at Hashadîr\tCorsairs can be found at Hashadîr in south-western Belfalas. You should defeat Corsairs at Hashadîr.\n2\tDefeat Corsairs at Hashadîr (total: 10)\tCorsairs can be found at Hashadîr in south-western Belfalas. You should defeat Corsairs at Hashadîr.\n3\tCompletado\tYou have defeated numerous Corsairs at Hashadîr, lessening the threat to the shores of Gondor.\n",
[3597]="70040E83\n1\tDefeat Corsairs on their ships (total: 10)\tCorsairs can be found on the ships anchored off the beach of Hashadîr, in southern Belfalas. You should defeat Corsairs on their ships.\n2\tCompletado\tYou have defeated numerous Corsairs on their ships. The threat from the ships parked offshore from Hashadîr is lessened due to your valiant efforts.\n",
[3598]="70065AA2\n1\tBring the note to Irodon in Halach\tYou have found a Corsair note detailing Halach's guard rotations. You ought to bring this note to Irodon in Halach, which is south-west of the camp-site.\n",
[3599]="70040CF4\n1\tReclaim stolen Gondorian relics at Abedec's Watch\tGondorian relics can be found on Corsairs at Abedec's Watch in southern Belfalas. You should reclaim stolen relics from the Corsairs.\n2\tReclaim stolen Gondorian relics (total: 10)\tGondorian relics can be found on Corsairs at Abedec's Watch in southern Belfalas. You should reclaim stolen relics from the Corsairs.\n3\tCompletado\tYou have reclaimed several Gondorian relics from the Corsairs at Abedec's Watch.\n",
[3600]="70062BDE\n1\tRecolecta Tusílago corrompido (total: 6)\030Recolecta Gentianella corrompida (total: 6)\tCoruwen te ha pedido que viajes a Hondonada del Terrón, al sur de Lintrev, para recolectar muestras de vegetación corrompida.\n2\tHabla con Coruwen\tCoruwen aguarda tu regreso con las muestras vegetales en Lintrev\n3\tMuele las plantas con el mortero y la mano.\tCoruwen te ha pedido que muelas las muestras corrompidas hasta obtener un polvo. El mortero y la mano de Coruwen se encuentran cerca, junto a su mesa de trabajo en Lintrev.\n4\tHabla con Coruwen\tCoruwen te instruye sobre cómo mezclar los ingredientes en el cuenco de mezcla junto a su mesa de trabajo en Lintrev.\n5\tMezcla los ingredientes en el cuenco.\tCoruwen ha pedido que mezcles las muestras con los ingredientes que ha preparado. El cuenco de mezcla puede encontrarse cerca de Coruwen, en Lintrev.\n6\tHabla con Coruwen\tEl brebaje purificador parece estar completo. Llévalo a Coruwen en Lintrev.\n7\tVierte el brebaje purificador\030Busca un lugar adecuado para verter el frasco.\tCoruwen te ha pedido que extiendas el brebaje purificador a lo largo de una fuente de agua corriente. Ella ha sugerido una cascada al sur de Lintrev que desemboca en Aguaestancada. La gente de los Valles de los Fuertes suele utilizar ese punto de agua. Deberías buscar sus pertenencias.\n8\tHabla con Coruwen\tLa solución purificadora ha sido vertida en una fuente de agua que desemboca en Aguaestancada. Esto debería ayudar con la corrupción de la sombra por ahora. Coruwen puede encontrarse en Lintrev. Debes informarle que el cometido está completo.\n",
[3601]="70059772\n1\tDestruye cajas de suministros en Cotfast\tLas cajas de suministros se pueden encontrar en Cotfast, en el Bosque Salvaje. Debes destruir las cajas de suministros de Cotfast.\n2\tDestruye cajas de suministros en Cotfast (total: 10)\tLas cajas de suministros se pueden encontrar en Cotfast, en el Bosque Salvaje. Debes destruir las cajas de suministros de Cotfast.\n",
[3602]="70059769\n1\tAcaba con enemigos en Cotfast\tEn Cotfast, en el Bosque Salvaje, hay enemigos. Debes derrotar a los enemigos de Cotfast.\n2\tAcaba con enemigos en Cotfast (total: 12)\tEn Cotfast, en el Bosque Salvaje, hay enemigos. Debes derrotar a los enemigos de Cotfast.\n",
